"Start coverage analysis in the specified path.\n"
"\n"
"The directory and, recursively, its subdirectories are scanned for .gcda "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Den Afdecken-Bericht för den angeven Padd utklamüstern.\n"
"\n"
"De Orner un sien Ünnerornern warrt na .gcda-Dateien dörkeken."

