"Number of covered lines in the selected directories.\n"
"\n"
"Covered lines are those that were executed at least once."
msgstr ""
"Tall vun afdeckt Regen binnen de utsöchten Ornern.\n"
"\n"
"Afdeckt Regen sünd de, de tominnst eenmaal utföhrt worrn."

#. i18n: file: tools/coverage/reportwidget.ui:141
