"Total number of lines of code in the selected directories.\n"
"\n"
"Note that it only includes executable lines. That is, things like comments, "
"macros, forward declarations... aren't taken into account."
msgstr ""
"De Tall vun all Koderegen tosamen binnen de utsöchten Ornern.\n"
"\n"
"Beacht bitte, dit deit bloots utföhrbor Regen insluten. Dat heet, Saken as "
"Kommentaren, Makros, Vörutverkloren usw. sünd nich mit op de Tell."

#. i18n: file: tools/coverage/reportwidget.ui:165
